\subsection{Project Management Tools}

The tools useful for project management are as follows:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item Cause and effect chart
  \item Gantt chart
  \item PERT chart
  \item Event Chain Diagram
  \item Project Cycle Optimization (PCO), etc.
